title: "tt-erf-fp32: FP32 erf for the Tenstorrent SFPU, at most 1 ULP on every input"
authors:
  - family-names: "El Hmissi"
    given-names: "Maher"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24485626"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maher75017/tt-erf-fp32"
abstract: "FP32 erf for the Tenstorrent SFPU (Blackhole, Wormhole): a kernel within 1 ULP on every input and a faster variant, both checked on every positive FP32 input with a bit-exact model of the hardware arithmetic. Proposed upstream in tenstorrent/tt-metal pull request 66809."
keywords:
  - Tenstorrent
  - SFPU
  - erf
  - floating point
  - exhaustive testing
  - numerical accuracy
